# The model is loaded automatically on server startup.
# If missing, the app runs in demo mode with random predictions.
#
# Expected path: trained_models/gesture_model.keras
# Input shape:   (1, 63)  — 21 landmarks × (x, y, z)
# Output shape:  (1, N)   — N gesture classes (softmax)
